Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,How do you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.17,0:00:01.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop a jet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:02.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,doing a hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.43,0:00:03.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,fifty miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:03.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:04.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,The deck is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.29,0:00:05.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,far too short
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.09,0:00:05.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,to brake, so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:06.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,the jet drops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:07.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,a hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:08.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,It snags one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,of four steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:10.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,cables stretched across
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.31,0:00:10.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Below deck, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,cable runs around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.19,0:00:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,pulleys to a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,giant hydraulic piston.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:16.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,As the jet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:17.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,drags the cable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,out, the piston
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:19.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,forces oil through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:20.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,a valve, turning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.57,0:00:21.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,speed into heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:22.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,It stops a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,fifty-thousand-pound\Njet in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:24.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,about the length
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:24.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:25.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,football field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:26.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,The pilot hits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:27.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,full throttle anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:28.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,in case the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:28.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,hook misses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:29.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's me in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:30.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,the cockpit, by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:30.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:31.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,And after a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,hundred\Ntwenty-five landings,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:33.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the cable gets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:34.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,thrown away.
